  "markdown_content": "## Film release\\n\\nNandamuri Kalyan Ram\u2019s Arjun S/o Vyjayanthi is now out in theatres. The emotional action drama rides heavily on mother-son sentiment.\\n\\n## Cast and crew\\n\\n- Nandamuri Kalyan Ram \u2014 lead\\n- Vijayashanthi \u2014 plays Kalyan Ram\u2019s mother\\n- Saiee Manjrekar \u2014 female lead\\n- Pradeep Chilukuri \u2014 director (earlier made Raja Cheyyi Vesthe)\\n\\n## Interview exchange\\n\\nDuring an interview, a journalist told Pradeep that the commercial cinema trope where the hero first acts as a criminal and later turns a cop has been overused. The director replied:\\n\\n> \u201cI am not at all worried about this aspect. Intellectual people criticize filmmakers who make commercial movies and often label them as run-of-the-mill directors.\u201d\\n\\n## Director\u2019s take on audience\\n\\nPradeep Chilukuri added:\\n\\n> \u201cCommercial films have a different set of audience. They are not made for intellectuals. Our Arjun S/o Vyjayanthi\u2019s target audience is different. I am sure they will surely connect to mother and son\u2019s emotion.\u201d\\n\\nThis is an interesting statement from the young director and let\u2019s see how the film fares at the box office.",
